# Task 143-015: Task Restoration on Crash — Execution Plan

## Goal
Phase transition auto-checkpoint + `deckent resume` crash recovery + stale heartbeat detection + DONE task skip.

## Analysis

### Current State
- `sprint-checkpoint.ts`: writeCheckpoint/readCheckpoint/getResumableTasks/restoreDepGraph exist
- Checkpoints written every N=5 completed tasks in `respawnEligibleTasks()` (sprint-spawner.ts)
- `resume.ts`: basic CLI that reads checkpoint and calls runSprint() — does NOT use checkpoint to filter tasks
- No phase-transition checkpoint writes exist
- No stale heartbeat detection (>5min) exists
- Resume doesn't respawn stale workers

### Changes Required

#### 1. sprint-checkpoint.ts — Add stale heartbeat detection + phase checkpoint helper
- `isStaleHeartbeat(hbPath, thresholdMs)`: reads .hb file, checks timestamp age
- `detectStaleWorkers(projectRoot, checkpoint, thresholdMs)`: scan activeWorkers against .hb files
- `writePhaseCheckpoint(projectRoot, sprint, phase, eventStreamOffset, graph?)`: convenience for phase transitions

#### 2. sprint-controller.ts — Phase transition auto-checkpoint
- After each phase transition (PLAN→SPAWN, SPAWN→EXECUTE, EXECUTE→EVALUATE, etc.), call writePhaseCheckpoint()
- Minimal changes: add import + 4-5 writeCheckpoint calls at phase boundaries

#### 3. resume.ts — Enhanced crash recovery
- Read checkpoint, detect stale heartbeats (>5min threshold)
- Kill stale workers
- Filter out DONE tasks from pending list
- Re-spawn only PENDING + stale-EXECUTING tasks
- Pass checkpoint context to runSprint via resumeContext option

#### 4. tests/orchestra/task-restoration.test.ts — 15+ tests
- Checkpoint write at phase transitions
- Checkpoint read/restore
- Stale heartbeat detection (fresh vs stale vs missing)
- Resume skips DONE tasks
- Resume detects stale workers
- Idempotent checkpoint writes
- Malformed heartbeat handling

## Files Modified
- src/orchestra/sprint-checkpoint.ts (add 3 functions ~60 LoC)
- src/orchestra/sprint-controller.ts (add ~10 LoC — checkpoint calls at phase boundaries)
- src/cli/commands/resume.ts (enhance ~40 LoC — stale detection + filtered respawn)
- tests/orchestra/task-restoration.test.ts (new, ~400 LoC, 15+ tests)
